// Declare app bundle identity — Usage:
//   std/build:app { name: "Tray Spike", id: "org.koru.trayspike", version: "0.1" }
// The compiler collects the declaration and embeds an Info.plist into
// __TEXT,__info_plist of the output binary (macho targets): an unbundled
// binary answers a real CFBundleIdentifier/CFBundleName — the gate
// notifications, process identity, and AppKit's real-app checks key on.
// The block is a Source capture like requires — key: "value" pairs the
// collector parses (name + id required, version optional); a declared-but-
// empty or malformed block is a parse error at collection, never a
// silently-defaulted identity.
~[comptime|norun]pub tor app {
    source: Source
}
| ?added
| ?parse-error string

~proc app|zig {
    return .{ .added = .{} };
}
